    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "No one hides in the cold now: the picture trap captures nature while you sleep.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6295,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7993
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "The camera has a heat feature: a warm creature moves, and the feature captures a picture.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6922,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "In the dark it captures pictures no one sees: a fox, a vulture, a creature with no name.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8359,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Most pictures capture nothing: grass, wind, a wet leaf. A nature team checks every picture.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8463,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9952
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Some pictures are a mixture of leg and tail. A creature can capture a picture of its own nose.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8254,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9351
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Every nature team captures a ghost picture: a white blur with no legs. It is a moth on the lens.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8829,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10840
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Nature crews count creatures in the pictures. Ten pictures of one fox is not ten foxes.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7679,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9064
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "The pictures show which creatures are still here. A creature with no picture slips away.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6765,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "In the future, a picture trap will capture a creature no one has pictured yet. Go hunt that picture.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_088/pages/p10.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_088/audio/pages/p10.mp3",
